#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Social Desktop (Open Collaboration Services) settings module lets you "
"configure your user accounts for Open Collaboration Service Providers."
msgstr ""
"Modul za postavke društvenog desktopa (Otvorenog sistema za suradnju)  "
"dozvoljava Vam da konfigurišete Vaš korisnički nalog za Provajdere otvorenog "
"sistema za suradnju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the time of writing <ulink url=\"http://opendesktop.org/\">openDesktop."
"org </ulink> is the first provider that you can use. You can use the web "
"site or this settings dialog to register and manage your account."
msgstr ""
"U vrijeme pisanja <ulink url=\"http://opendesktop.org/\">openDesktop.org </"
"ulink>  je prvi provajder koji možete koristiti. Možete koristiti ovu veb "
"stranicu ili ovaj okvir za postavke da se registrujete i upravljate vašim "
"nalogom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The benefit is that you can do more things in <quote>Get Hot New Stuff</"
"quote>: vote for items, become a fan of them and upload new content. A "
"configured account also allows you to use the social Plasma widgets "
"(<quote>Community</quote>, <quote>Social News</quote> &etc;) to their full "
"extent."
msgstr ""
"Prednosti su da možete uraditi više stvari u <quote>Nabavi nove popularne "
"stvari</quote>: glasati za stavke, postati njihov obožavatelj  i upload-"
"ovati novi sadržaj. Konfigurisani nalog vam također omogućuj da koristite "
"društvene Plasma kontrole (<quote>Zajednica</quote>, <quote>Društvene "
"vijesti</quote> &etc;) u njihovom punom obimu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the &systemsettings; module:"
msgstr "Upotreba &systemsettings; modula:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select which provider to configure at the top. Either enter your "
"existing user name and password to let &kde; use them. You can verify that "
"these work by using the <guibutton>Test Login</guibutton> button"
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati koji provajder da konfigurišete na vrhu. Ili možete unijeti "
"postojeće korisničko ime i šifru da dozvolite &kde; da ih koristi. Možete "
"provjeriti da ovo radi koristeći <guibutton>Testiraj prijavu</guibutton>  "
"dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you do not have an account yet, use the <guilabel>Register</guilabel> "
"tab. Here you need to fill out all fields. After clicking "
"<guibutton>Register...</guibutton> you will receive an email from the server "
"to activate your account."
msgstr ""
"Ako do sada jos nemate korisnički nalog, koristite <guilabel>Registruj</"
"guilabel> tab. Ovdje morate popuniti sva polja. Nakon klika na "
"<guibutton>Registruj...</guibutton> primit ćete email od servera pomoću "
"kojeg aktivirate vaš nalog."
